    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mastery of blood magic reaches its height, mitigating your sacrifice and sharpening your expertise. You gain the following benefits.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Reroll the Die.</strong></em> Once per turn, when a Blood Hunter feature has you roll a Hemocraft die, you can reroll the die and use either roll.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Sanguine Recovery.</strong></em> Whenever you score a Critical Hit with a weapon for which you have an active Crimson Rite, you regain one expended use of your Blood Maledict feature.</p>",
